    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm running a mid-sized manufacturing plant out in Ohio and we're getting hit pretty hard by these new carbon emission standards coming down the pipe. I have a meeting with our local reps next week to try and push back a bit. Can you give me a solid list of arguments against these new regulations that I can use to show how they're gonna affect us? I need stuff that sounds professional and hits on the economic side of things.",
