    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the economic impact. But I'm also worried about how people are gonna frame the 'environmental' side of this. If I bring up the cost issues, they're probably gonna hit me with the 'climate change is an emergency' argument. Can you give me a quick overview of what the main arguments are for these regulations so I'm not blindsided? Just want to see what I'm up against.",
